==Description==
'''Chilly''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was obtained from rank 1 of the free track, which costs {{Bell|30}} or {{Robux|32}}.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the default [[Freezer]] tower frozen in ice. Upon use, it plays a freezing sound.

